{"time_ns": 1794069885629699000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 15, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "170f2dda1807c2fcf75e17b33882805799819e458bcaea57741558c29f382e9a", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Overview\nThis report summarizes transaction data across three geographic regions from 24 records (R001-R024), totaling **1,123,741 cents** or approximately **$11,237.41**.\n\n## Regional Breakdown\n\n### North Region\n- **Total**: 358,151 cents ($3,581.51)\n- **Records**: 7 transactions\n- **Percentage of Total**: 31.9%\n\n### South Region  \n- **Total**: 348,956 cents ($3,489.56)\n- **Records**: 6 transactions\n- **Percentage of Total**: 31.1%\n\n### West Region\n- **Total**: 416,634 cents ($4,166.34)\n- **Records**: 11 transactions\n- **Percentage of Total**: 37.1%\n\n## Summary\nThe West region leads in transaction volume with 37.1% of total cents processed, while North and South regions are nearly balanced at 31.9% and 31.1% respectively. The analysis covers the complete dataset of 24 records across all three regions.\n\n## Data Quality\nAll 24 records from R001 through R024 have been accounted for and verified. Regional categorizations are consistent and complete.\n", "ok": true}
